{
  "language": "cpp",
  "title": "Learn C++17",
  "description": "Learn C++17 from your first std::cout to graph algorithms, with a close look at memory: the stack and heap, references, pointers, RAII, and copy and move semantics. Every step pairs a worked example with a practice problem of the same shape that you solve and check in the editor.",
